# Initial Testing

IF YOU ARE USING THIS REPOSITORY TO BUILD YOUR OWN BIONIC BUTTERFLY, YOU DON'T NEED TO USE THIS FOLDER, ITS ONLY HERE TO DOCUMENT MY PROCESS.

This folder contains early experiments performed before the final firmware.

These tests were used to verify:

- Servo movement
- Servo direction
- Servo limits
- Arduino output
- Receiver input
- Initial wing-motion concepts

These files are development experiments and are not necessarily the final firmware.

The final implementation is located in `Firmware/`.
